      "original_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,><C:0007,0000,><C:0001,0001,><C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF>Bir <C:0000,0003,00EAFFFF>Rüya Yumurtası<C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF> aldın!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0000,1E00><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,FFFFFFFF>",
